{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09208","headline":"善福精舍荅韩司录清都观会宴见忆 · 韦应物","name":"善福精舍荅韩司录清都观会宴见忆","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"弱志厌衆纷，抱素寄精庐。\n皦皦仰时彦，闷闷独爲愚。\n之子亦辞秩，高踪罢驰驱。\n忽因西飞禽，赠我以琼琚。\n始表仙都集，复言欢乐殊。\n人生各有因，契阔不获俱。\n一来田野中，日与人事疎。\n水木澄秋景，逍遥清赏余。\n枉驾怀前诺，引领岂斯须。\n无爲便高翔，邈矣不可迂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09208.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09208","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}